{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "GeoCollar phone API",
    "description": "How the GeoCollar phone app reaches its base station over the network, at home or over the\ninternet. A phone is linked with the one-time code in the QR code under **Connect app** on the\nbase page, and removed there too.\n\n**Every request and answer is encrypted** (AES-256-GCM) with a key of that phone's own, so plain\nHTTP is safe here and a proxy in between can't read or change anything.\n\n1. **Enrol** (`POST /api/phone/v1/enroll`): the phone posts a fresh P-256 public key with the\n   code's token and an HMAC proving it read the code. The answer carries the base's fresh public\n   key. API key = HKDF-SHA256(ECDH secret, salt = code secret, info = \"GeoCollar phone API v1\" ||\n   token || phone key || base key), 32 bytes. The answer's `ct` opens with it to a `Welcome`.\n2. **Every other operation** is `POST /api/phone/v1/<op>` with a `PhoneRequest`: `ct` opens with\n   associated data `GCP1 <op> <phone id>` to `{\"ts\": <ms>, \"body\": <request>}`. The answer is an\n   `Envelope` whose `ct` opens with associated data `GCR1 <op> <phone id> ` followed by the\n   request's 12-byte IV. Each operation's `x-plaintext` names the schemas of `body` and of the\n   opened answer. A request more than 10 minutes off the base's clock, or seen before, is refused.\n\nErrors are plain JSON (`ApiError`), never encrypted, and say nothing about the base's collars.\n",
    "version": "1.0.0"
  },
  "paths": {
    "/api/phone/v1/enroll": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "phone"
        ],
        "summary": "Link this phone with a Connect app code",
        "description": "Link a phone with the one-time code from the QR code (see the description above).",
        "operationId": "enroll",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/EnrollRequest"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/EnrollReply"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Damaged request",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiError"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Unknown phone, or clock too far off",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiError"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "Does not match the code",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiError"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "409": {
            "description": "Seen before",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiError"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "410": {
            "description": "Code ran out or was used",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiError"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "413": {
            "description": "Too large",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiError"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "x-plaintext": {
          "reply": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Welcome"
          }
        }
      }
    },
